915b6d", "type": "numerical", "chapters": ["60e2fadb66f9ce3f243b4798"], "topics": ["60e2fada66f9ce3f243b4759"], "concepts": ["60e40fd4f1ef260f84ed1e39"], "question": {"text": "<p>As per the given circuit, the value of current through the battery will be _____ A.</p><p><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/quantrexacademy-app.firebasestorage.app/o/questions%2Ffigs%2Fpyq%2Fjee_main%2F9518db1d-9c7e-494a-ab9a-77517b6ea6ee-image.png?alt=media\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 142px;\" /></p>"}, "options": [{"id": "f4343a", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f42c677dc36a8915b6e"}, {"id": "8016ff", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f42c677dc36a8915b6f"}, {"id": "884b12", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f42c677dc36a8915b70"}, {"id": "de97a9", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f42c677dc36a8915b71"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f42c677dc36a8915b72", "type": "numerical", "chapters": ["60e2fadb66f9ce3f243b4798"], "topics": ["60e2fada66f9ce3f243b4759"], "concepts": ["60e2fad966f9ce3f243b470c"], "question": {"text": "A potential barrier of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> exists across a p-n junction. An electron enters the junction from the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>-side with a speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The speed with which electron enters the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math> side will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is&nbsp;_____.: (Given mass of electron <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math>, charge on electron <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>.)"}, "options": [{"id": "a944dd", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f42c677dc36a8915b73"}, {"id": "ea37cc", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f42c677dc36a8915b74"}, {"id": "5f59a6", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f42c677dc36a8915b75"}, {"id": "b9210b", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f42c677dc36a8915b76"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f42c677dc36a8915b77", "type": "numerical", "chapters": ["60e2fadb66f9ce3f243b4798"], "topics": ["60e2fada66f9ce3f243b4759"], "concepts": ["60e2fb1f66f9ce3f243b4b1d"], "question": {"text": "<p>The value of power dissipated across the zener diode <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> connected in the circuit as shown in the figure is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/quantrexacademy-app.firebasestorage.app/o/questions%2Ffigs%2Fpyq%2Fjee_main%2F40a2000b-749c-416a-b750-94cbb14554fa-image.png?alt=media\" style=\"width: 298px; height: 125px;\" /><